# Google OAuth 2.0 — credentials for the portal

Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) for local development, or set the same
variables in your deploy platform (Render/Railway env vars).

```
# 1) Google Cloud project -> OAuth Client ID (Web application) -> copy here:
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# 2) The EXACT redirect URI you registered in the Google console:
#    local dev
OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/callback
#    deployed (Render/Railway domains, https!)
# OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=https://credence-predelinquency.onrender.com/auth/callback

# 3) Session signing secret (any long random string)
PREDELINQ_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
```

`python-dotenv` is loaded automatically by `frontend/app.py` when `.env`
exists; production prefers platform env vars.
